  "notes": "Warm parchment palette (#f3eee4 dotted background) with a dark espresso primary (#2a241d) instead of a typical blue dev-tool theme; colour-blind-safe Okabe-Ito-like coverage scale. Floating rounded panels (12px radius, thin #ddd4c3 border, soft shadow) sit over a full-bleed SVG map. Service regions drawn as dashed, tinted blobs with serif labels; folders as smaller outlined blobs; modules as dots sized by lines. Trail drawn as heavy black arrows with numbered circles matching the left list; blast radius as amber halos/rings; dependencies as dashed lines; open issues as dark tag callouts (#212). Inline mini coverage bars throughout lists. Copy is humane and onboarding-oriented ('Untouched for a long while', 'Copy a question for Marco', 'Who’s been in this area'). Live-only: deselecting (Esc) shows a 'Nothing selected' empty state with a 'Big and lightly tested' list; search '/' opens typeahead mixing issues, volunteers and modules; repo switcher opens a read-only project overview popover."
